- Added Omarchy as a supported Linux platform. Omarchy 4 reports `platform=omarchy` where earlier versions reported `arch`, which stopped Fleet from recognizing these hosts as Linux. Host vitals and software inventory now populate, disk encryption and key escrow are available, policies and labels scoped to `linux` apply, and scripts can be run from the host's Actions menu. Omarchy hosts roll up onto the "Arch Linux" / "rolling" row in Software > OS.
